# Route: guide 46 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1539 of 1546 eligible quests, 166.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to
# 60, 46 quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Felwood, Ashenvale, Thousand Needles, Tanaris, Swamp of Sorrows,
# Azshara, The Barrens): Emerald Sanctuary -> Jaedenar -> Irontree Woods ->
# Emerald Sanctuary -> Bloodvenom Falls -> Emerald Sanctuary -> The Zoram
# Strand -> The Shrine of Aessina -> Lake Falathim -> Astranaar -> Lake
# Falathim -> Mystral Lake -> Satyrnaar -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Name of the Beast (3510;
# Hetaera 55).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (1200), The Crone of the Kraul
# (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770), Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865),
# Troll Temper (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447),
# The Prophecy of Mosh'aru (3527), The God Hakkar (3528), The Final Tablets
# (4788), Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers
# (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate
# Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

